        </div>

        <div class="tabs" id="calc-tabs">
          <button class="tab active" data-tab="calc-deriv">Derivatives</button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="calc-gradient">Gradient Descent</button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="calc-chain">Chain Rule</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Derivatives -->
        <div class="tab-content active" id="tab-calc-deriv">
          <div class="instruction-box">
            <span class="instruction-icon">👆</span>
            Drag the point along the curve to see the tangent line and derivative value change.
          </div>
          <div class="controls-panel">
            <div class="control-group">
              <span class="control-label">Function</span>
              <select id="deriv-func">
                <option value="x2">f(x) = x²</option>
                <option value="x3">f(x) = x³</option>
                <option value="sin">f(x) = sin(x)</option>
                <option value="exp">f(x) = eˣ</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="control-group">
              <span class="control-label">x =</span>
              <input type="range" id="deriv-x" min="-3" max="3" step="0.05" value="1" />
              <span class="control-value" id="deriv-x-val">1.00</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-2">
            <div class="canvas-container">
              <canvas id="deriv-canvas" width="500" height="400"></canvas>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-md);">
                <div class="card-title">📐 At this point</div>
                <div class="stats-row" id="deriv-stats"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="card">
                <div class="card-title">📝 Derivative Rules</div>
                <div class="math-block" id="deriv-formula"></div>
                <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:var(--space-sm);">
                  The derivative f'(x) gives the slope of the tangent line at point x. 
                  It tells us the instantaneous rate of change of the function.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Gradient Descent -->
        <div class="tab-content" id="tab-calc-gradient">
